# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: HyralArc | Scene: HyralOrc2

translate pt strings:

    old "A few yards, in a cage very similar to hers, she saw two shadow figures, moving."
    new "A poucos metros, numa gaiola muito semelhante à dela, ela viu duas figuras sombrias a mover-se."

    old "A large orc stood near the cage, hitting the bars with a stick."
    new "Um grande orco estava perto da jaula, batendo nas barras com um bastão."

    old "A ferocious screaming and roaring exploded as he was crowned the victor."
    new "Um grito e um rugido ferozes explodiram quando ele foi coroado vitorioso."

    old "A princess turned sailor. A sailor turned slave. Wife to an orc."
    new "Uma princesa virada marinheira. Um marinheiro virado escravo. Esposa de um orco."
